The '''Cat Bros''' are a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[The Battle Cats Unite! (Special Event)|The Battle Cats Unite!]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 501
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Cat Bros
|name2 = Baka Cat Bros
|key1 = Cat Bros R
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Baka Cat Bros''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cat Bros are not a very good meatshield outside of [[Empire of Cats]] and early [[Legend Stages]]. After that, their health, cost, knockback count and recharge time combine to make them decent at best, even against Traitless foes. Although they can be improved through Research and Resistant [[Cat Combo]]s, there are better options that do not need combos to be used. Once other anti-Traitless meatshields like [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] or [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Wall Cat]] are obtained, these two can be forgotten.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

